ndex (autoload excerpt):\n# MEMORY (AUTOLOADED INDEX)\n\n## What this is\n- Autoloaded memory index for this project.\n- Keep this file concise and pointer-first.\n- Put details in MEMORY/topics/*.md.\n\n## Latest State\n- Current focus: Compute O2 in a box: prepare VASP inputs from scratch, DO perform VASP calculation to get the results, and report final energy per atom and O–O bond distance from vasp results.\n- Current milestone: (empty)\n- Latest run artifact: (empty)\n- Next action: (empty)\n\n## Top Constraints\n1. (empty)\n\n## Active Open Questions\n1. (empty)\n\n## Pointers\n- Goal / principles: MEMORY/topics/GOAL.md\n- Facts / decisions: MEMORY/topics/FACTS.md\n- Files / artifacts: MEMORY/topics/FILES.md\n- Constraints: MEMORY/topics/CONSTRAINTS.md\n- Open questions: MEMORY/topics/QUESTIONS.md\n- Runbook: MEMORY/topics/RUNBOOK.md\n\n## Keyword Map\n- GOAL: objective, success criteria, scope, non-goals\n- FACTS: definition, verified, result, decision\n- FILES: path, artifact, dataset, output, script\n- CONSTRAINTS: must, cannot, policy, budget\n- QUESTIONS: unknown, blocked, clarify, decide\n- RUNBOOK: steps, checklist, verify\n\n\nRecent task outcomes history (oldest -> newest, MarkdownKV records):\n## Record 1\n\n```md\ntask_id: task_01\nstatus: success\noutcome: success\ngoal: Run a VASP relaxation for gas-phase O2 in a large cubic box and extract final energy/atom and O–O bond length.\nsummary: Completed gas-phase O2 VASP relaxation workflow. Created and prepared `o2_vasp/relax/` with VASP inputs, executed a single relaxation, copied key outputs into the requested directory, parsed final TOTEN and energy/atom, computed final O–O bond length from CONTCAR, and wrote `o2_vasp/RESULTS.md` with settings and evidence references.\nartifact_count: 5\ndecision_count: 2\n```\n","role":"user"},{"content":null,"role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"type":"function","id":"call_iEKieAbmPvQHQTG2g2Sbz1Of","function":{"name":"read_text_file","arguments":"{\"path\": \"o2_vasp/RESULTS.md\", \"tail\": 200, \"head\": 0}"}}]},{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"# O2 gas-phase VASP relaxation results\n\n## Setup\n- Work directory: `o2_vasp/relax/`\n- System: O2 (triplet), cubic box from generated structure (`~19.15 Å` per side)\n- Input preparation: VASP relax inputs prepared and then run in single-job mode\n\n## Key VASP settings used\nFrom `o2_vasp/relax/INCAR`:\n- `PREC = Accurate`\n- `ENCUT = 520.0`\n- `EDIFF = 1e-06`\n- `EDIFFG = -0.02`\n- `ISPIN = 2`\n- `MAGMOM = 2*1.0`\n- `ISMEAR = 0`\n- `SIGMA = 0.05`\n- `IBRION = 2`\n- `NSW = 100`\n- `ISIF = 2`\n- `ISYM = 0`\n- `LCHARG = False`\n- `LWAVE = False`\n\nFrom `o2_vasp/relax/KPOINTS`:\n- Gamma-only `1 1 1`\n\n## Final energies\n- Final TOTEN (last ionic step): **-9.88463049 eV**\n  - Evidence: `o2_vasp/relax/toten_line.txt`\n  - OUTCAR reference: `o2_vasp/relax/OUTCAR` line `9468`:\n    - `free  energy   TOTEN  =        -9.88463049 eV`\n- Energy per atom: **-4.94231524 eV/atom**\n  - Computed as TOTEN/2\n  - Evidence: `o2_vasp/relax/energy_summary.txt`\n\n## Final O–O bond length\n- O–O distance from final `CONTCAR`: **1.2332545376 Å**\n  - Evidence: `o2_vasp/relax/bond_length.txt`\n  - Source structure: `o2_vasp/relax/CONTCAR`\n","id":"lc_9ff31bc6-062d-4e04-8b5a-43877e7d7eeb"}],"role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_iEKieAbmPvQHQTG2g2Sbz1Of"},{"content":null,"role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"type":"function","id":"call_175SAYK0ifEuqG6wfv7jOpPn","function":{"name":"read_multiple_files","arguments":"{\"paths\": [\"o2_vasp/relax/energy_summary.txt\", \"o2_vasp/relax/bond_length.txt\", \"o2_vasp/relax/toten_line.txt\"]}"}}]},{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"o2_vasp/relax/energy_summary.txt:\nTOTEN_eV=-9.88463049\nenergy_per_atom_eV=-4.94231524\n\n\n---\n/home/chenhh/python_projects/CatMaster/project_space/test_o2_10/files/o2_vasp/relax/bond_length.txt:\n1.2332545376\n\n\n---\n/home/chenhh/python_projects/CatMaster/project_space/test_o2_10/files/o2_vasp/relax/toten_line.txt:\n9468:  free  ener